{"dialogue": {"lines": [{"en": "How is the weather today?", "r": "Aaj mausam kaisa hai?", "sp": "Asha", "t": "आज मौसम कैसा है?"}, {"en": "Clouds since morning. It may rain.", "r": "Subah se baadal hain. Baarish ho sakti hai.", "sp": "Ravi", "t": "सुबह से बादल हैं। बारिश हो सकती है।"}, {"en": "Then take the umbrella.", "r": "To chhaata le lo.", "sp": "Asha", "t": "तो छाता ले लो।"}, {"en": "Yes, and come home early.", "r": "Haan, aur jaldi ghar aa jaana.", "sp": "Ravi", "t": "हाँ, और जल्दी घर आ जाना।"}], "title": "Morning sky"}, "lede": "Seasons, sky and the living land — Hindi for the world outside.", "phrases": [{"en": "it is very hot", "r": "bahut garmi hai", "t": "बहुत गर्मी है"}, {"en": "take the umbrella", "r": "chhaata le lijiye", "t": "छाता ले लीजिए"}, {"en": "the sun has risen", "r": "suraj nikla", "t": "सूरज निकला"}, {"en": "meet in the evening", "r": "shaam ko milenge", "t": "शाम को मिलेंगे"}, {"en": "it is raining", "r": "baarish ho rahi hai", "t": "बारिश हो रही है"}, {"en": "how cold it is!", "r": "kitni thand hai!", "t": "कितनी ठंड है!"}, {"en": "look at the rainbow", "r": "indradhanush dekhiye", "t": "इंद्रधनुष देखिए"}, {"en": "the moon is out", "r": "chaand nikla hai", "t": "चाँद निकला है"}, {"en": "stars are shining", "r": "taare chamak rahe hain", "t": "तारे चमक रहे हैं"}, {"en": "the crop is good", "r": "fasal achhi hai", "t": "फ़सल अच्छी है"}, {"en": "the river is full", "r": "nadi bhari hai", "t": "नदी भरी है"}, {"en": "sit in the shade", "r": "chhaaon mein baithiye", "t": "छाँव में बैठिए"}], "quiz": [{"a": "weather", "explain": "मौसम (mausam) = weather — आज मौसम कैसा है?", "id": "hi-55", "lesson": "hindi/advanced/weather", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["weather", "season", "climate", "forecast"], "q": "मौसम means…", "topic": "weather", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "बारिश", "explain": "बारिश = rain; बूँदाबाँदी = drizzle.", "id": "hi-56", "lesson": "hindi/advanced/weather", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["बारिश", "बाढ़", "सूखा", "कोहरा"], "q": "Which is 